%Modem4%   = Modem4,   MICROCOM_Modem4, UNIMODEMC9720A17                                    ; Microcom DeskPorte ES 14.4
%Modem3P%  = Modem3P,  MICROCOM_Modem3P                                                     ; Microcom TravelPorte FAST parallel
